      "alt": "rindemption3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can just ignore her.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I find myself talking to Otoha and Nodoka sometime in the middle of the class.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I tend to stop keeping track after the first hour because time is a meaningless construct and thinking about it for extended periods irritates me more than a stubborn hangnail.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you need, Otoha?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not everyday that you of all people approach me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. I try to keep my distance because there are a few girls that glare daggers at me any time I come close.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not that I really want to anyway, but yeah.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well thank you for being so polite and informing me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If it’s any consolation, Sensei, I thrive off of the piercing gazes of our classmates.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come. Jump into my arms and show the world how we were meant to be.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shouldn’t you be the one jumping into my arms?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Too predictable. I say we shake things up a bit.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I continue now or do you two want to keep being secret siblings for a little while longer?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption4.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Apologies, Otoha. Please proceed with inviting Sensei to your topless slumber party.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I accept. I’ll mark it on my calendar.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption5.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least wait until after[school] if you’re going to be a creep.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, you’re the one who invited me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is no topless sleepover. I wanted to ask if we needed like, permission slips or whatever for the beach thing.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. No, you should be fine.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption6.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So...this[school] is just going to let a bunch of [teenage]girls stay overnight with a guy everyone is already suspicious of and not even make us get permission from our parents?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No one is suspicious of me. I’m a totally normal guy with totally normal taste in women.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Look. Just ask Makoto.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption7.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm? I’m Makoto.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why am I being mentioned?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Tell Otoha how normal I am.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You? Normal?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Next you’re going to be asking me to explain to her how Caligula was an entirely sane and widely appreciated emperor.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That does not sound like something I would ever ask you to explain to anyone.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, Makoto. Loyal class representative and beautiful [young_girl].",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would you like to hold hands and lovingly peer through the frames of each other’s glasses for the rest of the day?",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption8.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello Nodoka. No thank you.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rats.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption9.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If there’s something you’re curious about that Sensei doesn't know how to answer, you can always ask me.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I believe I overheard something about the beach?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, yeah. I was just wondering if we needed to like, get permission from our parents or anything.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption10.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": For any other class, yes. That is something you’d need.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": However, given that I am not only the class president but the head of the student council and an occasional assistant to the principal, I have my ways of averting typical requirements like that.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So fear not, Otoha. I’m able to get all of you to the beach with just Sensei’s supervision alone.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And that’s something you’re comfortable with?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption11.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait. Yeah. Why am I just allowing this to happen?",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m supposed to be making sure the safety of the class is the top priority and-",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I, for one, feel there is no place safer than in the arms of a man twice my size.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come, Sensei. To the closet.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption12.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The janitorial closets are off limits to staff members who aren’t part of the custodial roster.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can’t there be a momentary exception to that on account of all of the lives that have been lost in that department?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure. As long as you sign out the needed materials.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do they keep condoms in there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption13.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": AS IF YOU’D WILLINGLY USE ONE OF THOSE!",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh? What’s this?",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhhhhhhhhhhhhhh...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption14.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Um...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I...just meant that...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I heard somewhere that...boys think they’re uncomfortable and...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, I forgot. I have a...meeting to attend.",
      "spk": "Makoto",
      "spkColor": "#5D84FF",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption15.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": At least I can get around having to tell my mom about this.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Forget your mom. I want to hear more about what’s going on with Sensei and his faithful assistant.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have no idea what you’re talking about.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Makoto was probably just a little upset about the whole janitorial topic since she used to be dating one of the custodians.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that who was bumping into us during our first time?",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Up until now, I had just assumed it was a mop.",
      "spk": "Nodoka",
      "spkColor": "#AF89A2",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nope. That’s just how wet-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okaaaaythanksforyourtimebyeeee.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption16.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yumi, you don’t think we’d be able to bring Chinami to the beach if we like, be super careful about it, do you?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fuck if I know. You’re the one who understands her health shit. I just know the outside world wants to kill her.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Beach seems pretty fuckin’ outside to me.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami?",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption17.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah! I apologize!",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I inadvertently invited myself into a conversation I had no part in! How terribly rude of me!",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No no no! It’s totally fine. You can talk to us whenever you want!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No you can’t.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption18.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami’s my little sister.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s a 5,000 year old wizard.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What a strange coincidence. My little sister also happens to be a 5,000 year old wizard.",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow! It’s so crazy that both of our sisters are 5,000 year old wizards!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And um...I’m deeply sorry if it’s inappropriate for me, but... by health...you know what, is your bodyguard referring to your sister's disorder?",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/rindemption19.webp",
      "alt": "rindemption19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Health “shit.” Stop actin’ like a fuckin’ princess and just say it.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bad words won’t fuckin’ kill you, you know.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah. She has to stay home most of the time and can’t really go anywhere without...protective gear.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You mean like...a hazmat suit of sorts?",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guess again, but with more fur.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chika?",
      "spk": "Touka",
      "spkColor": "#F0E68C",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sorry. I’m just gonna go call her really quick and see how she’s doing.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene rindemption20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
